      "source_ref": "scripts/eval/dataset.json:m10"
    },
    {
      "id": "m11",
      "kind": "procedure",
      "content": "DSH profile 覆盖层新增插件必须用 insert: 键，纯 id+name 条目会报 entry not found",
      "source_ref": "scripts/eval/dataset.json:m11"
    },
    {
      "id": "m12",
      "kind": "procedure",
      "content": "跑隔离测试用 dsh --profile headless --patch 覆盖层文件，模型凭据从启动环境注入，--patch 可重复叠加",
      "source_ref": "scripts/eval/dataset.json:m12"
    },
    {
      "id": "m13",
      "kind": "procedure",
      "content": "npm 缓存被 root 权限污染时，用 npm_config_cache=/tmp/新目录 绕过，不需要 sudo",
      "source_ref": "scripts/eval/dataset.json:m13"
    },
    {
      "id": "m14",
      "kind": "procedure",
      "content": "DSH 网页界面裸地址会返回 401，必须用带 token 的完整链接打开",
      "source_ref": "scripts/eval/dataset.json:m14"
    },
    {
      "id": "m15",
      "kind": "procedure",
      "content": "SQLite FTS5 外部内容表不能重复插入同 rowid，否则索引损坏报 database disk image is malformed，重建需删库重导",
      "source_ref": "scripts/eval/dataset.json:m15"
    },
